title: Chandelier
text: Red and blue must both reach the chandelier to make it glow magenta. They can't both come down the chain.
trick: two beams that strike a starburst straight mix on all four diagonal rays; one mirror can't drop both lasers onto the chain, so one comes in from the side
motif: a chandelier: a starburst hung from a rod, four magenta arms, two drops hanging from benders
ink: 4
expect: shared>=2
